cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Into the Edge, its engine, texts or illustrations, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Into the Edge: an interactive zoom from a cutting tool to the atoms of its coating"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, browser-based zoom from a gold-coated drill bit in the palm of a hand
  down to the atoms of its PVD coating, from 20 cm to 5 Å. Every level has a
  plain-language caption, a familiar object drawn at true scale for comparison and a
  card for researchers with the method used at that scale and an open question.
  The engine is journey-agnostic: a new zoom for another material is one config file
  plus texts.
